[{"label":"A discussion","html":"<section\n  aria-labelledby=\"discussion-title\"\n  style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.25rem; width: 100%; max-width: 44rem\"\n>\n  <header class=\"mk-comment-header\">\n    <h2 class=\"mk-comment-header-title\" id=\"discussion-title\"\n      >Comments <span class=\"badge\" data-variant=\"secondary\">3</span></h2\n    >\n    <div class=\"mk-comment-header-actions\">\n      <label class=\"mk-comment-header-sort\"\n        >Sort by\n        <select class=\"select\" data-size=\"sm\" name=\"sort\">\n          <option>Top</option>\n          <option>Newest</option>\n          <option>Oldest</option>\n        </select>\n      </label>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n  <form class=\"mk-comment-form\" aria-label=\"Add a comment\">\n    <span class=\"avatar\"><img class=\"avatar-image\" src=\"images/mk-portrait.png\" alt=\"\" /></span>\n    <div class=\"mk-comment-form-main\">\n      <textarea\n        class=\"textarea\"\n        name=\"comment\"\n        rows=\"2\"\n        required\n        minlength=\"2\"\n        placeholder=\"Join the discussion…\"\n        aria-label=\"Comment\"\n      ></textarea>\n      <div class=\"mk-comment-form-footer\">\n        <p class=\"mk-comment-form-hint\">Markdown works. Be kind.</p>\n        <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn\">Post comment</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </form>\n  <div>\n    <article class=\"mk-comment-item\" id=\"d-1\">\n      <span class=\"avatar\"><img class=\"avatar-image\" src=\"images/mk-portrait2.png\" alt=\"\" /></span>\n      <div class=\"mk-comment-item-main\">\n        <header class=\"mk-comment-item-head\">\n          <a class=\"mk-comment-item-author\" href=\"#\">Hannah Lee</a>\n          <a class=\"mk-comment-item-time\" href=\"#d-1\"><time datetime=\"2026-10-01T08:12\">2 hours ago</time></a>\n        </header>\n        <div class=\"mk-comment-item-body\"\n          ><p\n            >The write-ahead log section finally made CRDTs click for me. Would love a follow-up on how you\n            garbage-collect old operations.</p\n          ></div\n        >\n        <footer class=\"mk-comment-item-actions\">\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn\" data-variant=\"ghost\" data-size=\"xs\" aria-label=\"Like (24)\"\n            ><i data-lucide=\"thumbs-up\"></i> 24</button\n          >\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn\" data-variant=\"ghost\" data-size=\"xs\"\n            ><i data-lucide=\"reply\"></i> Reply</button\n          >\n        </footer>\n      </div>\n      <ol class=\"mk-comment-item-replies\">\n        <li>\n          <article class=\"mk-comment-item\" id=\"d-2\">\n            <span class=\"avatar\"><img class=\"avatar-image\" src=\"images/mk-portrait.png\" alt=\"\" /></span>\n            <div class=\"mk-comment-item-main\">\n              <header class=\"mk-comment-item-head\">\n                <a class=\"mk-comment-item-author\" href=\"#\">Sophie Tan</a\n                ><span class=\"badge\" data-variant=\"outline\">Author</span>\n                <a class=\"mk-comment-item-time\" href=\"#d-2\"><time datetime=\"2026-10-01T09:03\">1 hour ago</time></a>\n              </header>\n              <div class=\"mk-comment-item-body\"\n                ><p\n                  >That is next on the list! Short version: we compact once every replica has acknowledged an\n                  operation.</p\n                ></div\n              >\n              <footer class=\"mk-comment-item-actions\">\n                <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn\" data-variant=\"ghost\" data-size=\"xs\" aria-label=\"Like (11)\"\n                  ><i data-lucide=\"thumbs-up\"></i> 11</button\n                >\n                <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn\" data-variant=\"ghost\" data-size=\"xs\"\n                  ><i data-lucide=\"reply\"></i> Reply</button\n                >\n              </footer>\n            </div>\n          </article>\n        </li>\n        <li>\n          <article class=\"mk-comment-item\" id=\"d-3\">\n            <span class=\"avatar\"><img class=\"avatar-image\" src=\"images/mk-portrait.png\" alt=\"\" /></span>\n            <div class=\"mk-comment-item-main\">\n              <header class=\"mk-comment-item-head\">\n                <a class=\"mk-comment-item-author\" href=\"#\">Aron Homberg</a>\n                <a class=\"mk-comment-item-time\" href=\"#d-3\"><time datetime=\"2026-10-01T09:30\">40 minutes ago</time></a>\n              </header>\n              <div class=\"mk-comment-item-body\"><p>Seconded - and how it plays with the 30-day branch rule.</p></div>\n              <footer class=\"mk-comment-item-actions\">\n                <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn\" data-variant=\"ghost\" data-size=\"xs\" aria-label=\"Like (3)\"\n                  ><i data-lucide=\"thumbs-up\"></i> 3</button\n                >\n                <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn\" data-variant=\"ghost\" data-size=\"xs\"\n                  ><i data-lucide=\"reply\"></i> Reply</button\n                >\n              </footer>\n            </div>\n          </article>\n        </li>\n      </ol>\n    </article>\n    <article class=\"mk-comment-item\" id=\"d-4\">\n      <span class=\"avatar\"><img class=\"avatar-image\" src=\"images/mk-portrait2.png\" alt=\"\" /></span>\n      <div class=\"mk-comment-item-main\">\n        <header class=\"mk-comment-item-head\">\n          <a class=\"mk-comment-item-author\" href=\"#\">Priya Natarajan</a>\n          <a class=\"mk-comment-item-time\" href=\"#d-4\"><time datetime=\"2026-10-01T07:02\">3 hours ago</time></a>\n        </header>\n        <div class=\"mk-comment-item-body\"><p>Is the 30-day branch rule configurable per workspace?</p></div>\n        <footer class=\"mk-comment-item-actions\">\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn\" data-variant=\"ghost\" data-size=\"xs\" aria-label=\"Like (5)\"\n            ><i data-lucide=\"thumbs-up\"></i> 5</button\n          >\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn\" data-variant=\"ghost\" data-size=\"xs\"\n            ><i data-lucide=\"reply\"></i> Reply</button\n          >\n        </footer>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n    <form\n      class=\"mk-comment-form\"\n      data-variant=\"reply\"\n      aria-label=\"Reply to Priya Natarajan\"\n      style=\"padding-inline-start: 3.25rem\"\n    >\n      <span class=\"avatar\" data-size=\"sm\"><img class=\"avatar-image\" src=\"images/mk-portrait.png\" alt=\"\" /></span>\n      <div class=\"mk-comment-form-main\">\n        <textarea\n          class=\"textarea\"\n          name=\"reply\"\n          rows=\"1\"\n          required\n          placeholder=\"Reply to Priya…\"\n          aria-label=\"Reply to Priya Natarajan\"\n        ></textarea>\n        <div class=\"mk-comment-form-footer\">\n          <button type=\"reset\" class=\"btn\" data-variant=\"ghost\" data-size=\"sm\">Cancel</button>\n          <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn\" data-size=\"sm\">Reply</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </form>\n  </div>\n</section>\n","individual":false}]
